From bef3f6c9c0b1d0fdaa9f48c0a9fd5a9ba828ab7d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 02:34:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 48/53] Gym double battles

One trainer in each gym from Misty's on (not Cinnabar) fights a double
battle with a doubles moveset: spread moves that only hit foes, plus
Fake Out, Protect, screens, Trick Room and Helping Hand. Generated by
tools/hack/gym_doubles.py; tools/hack/learnsets.py checks every move.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
---
